        "description": "Variable degrees of intellectual disability",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of craniosynostosis, syndactyly of hands and feet, and confirmed FGFR2 mutation",
